that anything is amiss.

09:18.816 --> 09:20.816
(squeaking)

09:24.704 --> 09:26.822
(squeaking)

09:29.775 --> 09:32.144
"Your trash barrels
were a little close

09:32.178 --> 09:34.479
"to our driveway. Joe.

09:34.514 --> 09:36.381
"P.S. Please close
the windows

09:36.415 --> 09:38.383
"when you're giving
piano lessons.

09:38.417 --> 09:41.319
My legs don't work,
but my ears do."

09:42.855 --> 09:45.924
Brian, what are you doing
staring in Quagmire's window?

09:45.958 --> 09:48.792
Man, watching sex
in reverse is just bizarre.

10:00.056 --> 10:02.307
God, where does Quagmire
meet these women?

10:02.341 --> 10:03.808
(moaning)

10:07.063 --> 10:09.080
This is why Boxbuster
went out of business.

10:09.115 --> 10:11.031
Hey, what's going on
over there?

10:14.702 --> 10:16.238
(both gasp)

10:21.611 --> 10:23.494
My God, look at all
this devastation!

10:23.528 --> 10:24.596
What the hell happened?

10:24.647 --> 10:25.830
(whoosh, chicken clucks)

10:25.865 --> 10:29.267
(grunting)

10:29.318 --> 10:30.684
(clucks)
(grunts)

10:30.719 --> 10:33.238
(yelling)

10:33.272 --> 10:34.522
(grunts)

10:34.556 --> 10:37.525
(grunting)

10:37.559 --> 10:41.195
(groans)

10:41.229 --> 10:45.366
(slow-motion groaning)

10:45.400 --> 10:47.401
(grunting)

10:51.873 --> 10:54.592
(high-pitched whirring)

10:54.626 --> 10:56.627
(airplane engine whirring)

11:00.148 --> 11:04.752
(tires squealing, thudding)

11:04.786 --> 11:08.739
(grunting)

11:08.773 --> 11:10.774
(screaming)

11:16.948 --> 11:18.832
Okay, Seamus, today's the day

11:18.867 --> 11:20.768
you finally ask out
that barista.

11:20.802 --> 11:22.670
What's the worst
that could happen?

11:40.171 --> 11:42.355
You know, that chicken's kid
is in my preschool class.

11:42.389 --> 11:44.224
I don't really want
to be friends with him,

11:44.259 --> 11:45.659
but he knows a lot of chicks.

11:45.694 --> 11:47.461
And backwards rim shot.

11:47.495 --> 11:49.346
(backwards rim shot)

11:51.565 --> 11:54.517
Oh, Brian, this is gonna be
